OL,3,GNEWSASix months without bin collections
OL,4,Aprompts council tax refund call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident who has not had a bin
OL,7,Fcollection for six months since moving
OL,8,Fon to a new-build estate is seeking a
OL,9,F100% council tax rebate as
OL,10,Fcompensation.
OL,12,FBins finally arrived on Hawthorn
OL,13,FMeadows in Buckley, Flintshire, last
OL,14,Fmonth but Nathan Long and 60 other
OL,15,Fhouseholds can still only watch as
OL,16,Frefuse workers collect rubbish or
OL,17,Frecyclables from a nearby street.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
