OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASix months without bin collections
OL,4,Aprompts council tax refund call
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong said he wanted a rebate as he had
OL,7,Fbeen required to pay council tax since
OL,8,Fmoving in and despite disposing of
OL,9,Frubbish in skips provided by the estate
OL,10,Fdeveloper.
OL,12,FThe council said it was "working to
OL,13,Fresolve the situation" but a
OL,14,F"multi-step setup process must occur"
OL,15,Fbefore new waste and recycling
OL,16,Fcollection services are set up.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
